198
00:12:26,238 --> 00:12:28,160
好啦，你哋班肥腍腍嘅細路

199
00:12:28,200 --> 00:12:30,682
我要睇到啲油喺你哋個身度流出嚟

200
00:12:30,722 --> 00:12:31,843
冇人可以走

201
00:12:31,883 --> 00:12:35,366
直至到呢嚿聖誕火腿做到引體上升

202
00:12:38,341 --> 00:12:39,421
Hail to thee

203
00:12:39,461 --> 00:12:41,341
Camp Crosby

204
00:12:41,381 --> 00:12:44,981
By the shores
of Big Snake Lake

205
00:12:46,221 --> 00:12:49,702
Though your
swings are rusty

206
00:12:50,062 --> 00:12:53,823
We know they'
ll never break

207
00:12:53,863 --> 00:12:56,904
From your
gleaming mess

208
00:12:56,944 --> 00:13:00,505
On to your
hallowed baseball field

209
00:13:00,545 --> 00:13:03,065
To your thick
and spent inferno

210
00:13:03,105 --> 00:13:07,066
Where all our
wounds are healed

211
00:13:07,466 --> 00:13:10,347
Hail to the
camp crosseyed

