384
00:22:10,383 --> 00:22:13,066
South of
the border

385
00:22:13,508 --> 00:22:16,551
Down Mexico way

386
00:22:32,003 --> 00:22:35,049
Those mission
bells told me

387
00:22:35,651 --> 00:22:38,536
That I
must not stray

